# Security suppressions applied during template testing
# (`./workflow.cmd test`, `test.combo`, `test.matrix`).
#
# Merged with the `TEMPLATE_SECURITY_OVERRIDE` env var and passed to each
# generated project's `secure.audit` step via the
# `<PROJECT>_SECURITY_OVERRIDE` env var. The inner template validates the
# final list — see `template/.security-overrides`
# for the full format reference (CVE/GHSA/PYSEC IDs, optional `::YYYY-MM-DD`
# expiry).
#
# One entry per line. Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# Entries here reach the generated projects through an environment variable, not
# as a file, so each one MUST carry an `::YYYY-MM-DD` expiry — the inner template
# rejects permanent suppressions from that source, on the grounds that they would
# mute a finding with no reviewable record. Use `CVE-2024-1234::2026-12-31`.
